# Lazy evaluation: map on Seq does not apply the function until elements are accessed.
# take 0 returns Seq.End — if map were eager the raise would fire, but it's lazy so
# the function is never called and the result is an empty sequence terminal.
[take 0 [map [fn [let x] [raise "forced eagerly"]] [range 0 3]]]
=== out
Seq()
